d once every 25s. Incoming Resonators receive healing from Suisui at the cost of Enrichment.\n\nResonance Skill - Drizzle Stance\nWhile in Drizzle Stance, Resonance Skill - Zephyr Stance is replaced with Resonance Skill - Drizzle Stance.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} Resonance Skill to have Suisui thrust forward, dealing Glacio DMG. If Suisui is the active Resonator while casting the skill, restore Floral Epistle.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nThis skill shares a Cooldown with Resonance Skill - Zephyr Stance.","rows":[{"name":"Resonance Skill - Zephyr Stance DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[12,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[12.99,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[13.97,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[15.35,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[16.33,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[17.47,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[19.04,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[20.61,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[22.19,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[23.86,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[25.83,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[27.8,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[29.77,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[31.73,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[33.7,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[35.67,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[37.64,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[39.61,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[41.57,6]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[43.54,6]]}],"extra":[]},{"name":"Awakening Spring DMG","mult":[{"kind":"pct","hits":[[14.4,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[15.59,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[16.77,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[18.42,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[19.6,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[20.96,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[22.85,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[24.74,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[26.63,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[28.63,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[31,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[33.36,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[35.72,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[38.08,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[40.44,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[42.8,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[45.16,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[47.53,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[49.89,1]]},{"kind":"pct","hits":[[52